      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name} No. Still happens on build 1456.\n\nI think this happens because the team changed the string identifier of 22755 because we requested ( https://feedback.vrchat.com/localization/p/change-erroneous-mentions-of-private-world-to-private-instance-when-referring-to ) but the program still uses the old one, `User Is Online in a Private World`",
